  "caption_latex": "\\textbf{An intermediate controller enhances endpoint correlations.} {(a):} Cavity 2 supplies the measurement record and only spin 2 is actuated. {(b,c):} Signed connected endpoint $zz$ and $yy$ correlations. {(d):} Concurrence of the averaged endpoint state. Uniform/weak-end damping and feedback off/on are compared with the zero-hopping control. Parameters match Fig.~\\ref{fig:rabi}; the feedback gain is $f_2=0.15\\sqrt{\\omega_c}$, phase $\\pi/2$ and efficiency one. Solid nonlinear HOPS curves have pointwise 95\\% bands; same-colour dotted lines are matched finite-cutoff master equations. Neither spin endpoint is actuated. Schematic artwork generated with AI.",
